Patch summary:
External camera HAL for virtio-media host cameras:
- NV12/YUYV via libyuv; MJPEG preferred
- sizes and rates for range-reporting cameras
- fps: no 1 fps SIGFPE; rounding; fixed ranges
- per-stream crop; smallest covering mode
- buffers mapped once, at QUERYBUF offsets
- dequeue-time timestamps
- errored buffers skipped (10th used)
- vivid and v4l2loopback ignored
- buffers of an earlier stream not queued back after a restart
- a stream that gives no frame for 2 s is restarted, not waited on for good
- <LensFacing>
- temporal noise reduction: minimal, fast (default), high quality;
  edge-preserving chroma smoothing (3x3 fast, 5x5 high quality)

